{"about_the_game":"The Hero's Path, a concise hero development system. Every battle offers a unique character development opportunity. With attribute points in hand, you can freely decide which attribute to enhance. With skill points available, you have the freedom to choose which skill to learn or improve.<br><br>Skill System<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2724960/extras/56ad677de5684ee7e941e3ce582aaaba.avif?t=1710160933\" width=620 height=348 /></span><br>You are free to decide which skill to prioritize learning or which abilities to enhance when upgrading skills.<br><br>Attribute System<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2724960/extras/3a422f9fc4802f76767e8e37cdcd8c75.avif?t=1710160933\" width=620 height=348 /></span><br>The attribute column on the right allows you to freely choose which attribute to enhance when you have attribute points.<br><br>Shop System<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2724960/extras/beef3a46e1f67fca510f450ef3217c9b.avif?t=1710160933\" width=620 height=348 /></span><br>After obtaining gold during battles, you can purchase beneficial BUFFs at the Pig Merchant.<br><br>Equipment Crafting System<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2724960/extras/4bea41c43e80c1b10253252f9311ec7e.avif?t=1710160933\" width=620 height=348 /></span><br>When you are in battle, you will obtain 'Molds,' 'Materials,' and 'BOSS Drop Materials.' Only when you have all three types of materials can you craft equipment. Each material has different attributes, and crafting equipment will combine the attributes of the three materials into one piece of equipment.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2724960/extras/7c96b7185b9bb0845ee26988fb49a901.avif?t=1710160933\" width=620 height=348 /></span><br><br>Equipment System<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2724960/extras/f721087101fd539393a947d573881c15.avif?t=1710160933\" width=620 height=348 /></span><br>When you craft and equip gear, the attributes of the equipment take effect in the combat scenes.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2724960?t=1710160933","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2724960?t=1710160933","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2724960/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1710160933","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2724960/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1710160933","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Cartoon Violence"},"detailed_description":"The Hero's Path, a concise hero development system. Every battle offers a unique character development opportunity. With attribute points in hand, you can freely decide which attribute to enhance. With skill points available, you have the freedom to choose which skill to learn or improve.<br><br>Skill System<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2724960/extras/56ad677de5684ee7e941e3ce582aaaba.avif?t=1710160933\" width=620 height=348 /></span><br>You are free to decide which skill to prioritize learning or which abilities to enhance when upgrading skills.<br><br>Attribute System<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2724960/extras/3a422f9fc4802f76767e8e37cdcd8c75.avif?t=1710160933\" width=620 height=348 /></span><br>The attribute column on the right allows you to freely choose which attribute to enhance when you have attribute points.<br><br>Shop System<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2724960/extras/beef3a46e1f67fca510f450ef3217c9b.avif?t=1710160933\" width=620 height=348 /></span><br>After obtaining gold during battles, you can purchase beneficial BUFFs at the Pig Merchant.<br><br>Equipment Crafting System<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2724960/extras/4bea41c43e80c1b10253252f9311ec7e.avif?t=1710160933\" width=620 height=348 /></span><br>When you are in battle, you will obtain 'Molds,' 'Materials,' and 'BOSS Drop Materials.' Only when you have all three types of materials can you craft equipment. Each material has different attributes, and crafting equipment will combine the attributes of the three materials into one piece of equipment.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2724960/extras/7c96b7185b9bb0845ee26988fb49a901.avif?t=1710160933\" width=620 height=348 /></span><br><br>Equipment System<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2724960/extras/f721087101fd539393a947d573881c15.avif?t=1710160933\" width=620 height=348 /></span><br>When you craft and equip gear, the attributes of the equipment take effect in the combat scenes.","developers":["\u865a\u62df\u68a6"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2724960/header.jpg?t=1710160933","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_